                                "sense_id": "fc132088-6811-3d4b-8be0-a993704758a4",
                                "text": "Het vliegdekschip heeft een groot dek waarop vliegtuigen kunnen opstijgen en landen.",
                                "translation": "The aircraft carrier has a large deck on which airplanes can take off and land.",
                                "english": "The aircraft carrier has a large deck on which airplanes can take off and land."
