                                "sense_id": "fc132088-6811-3d4b-8be0-a993704758a4",
                                "text": "Het vliegdekscheepje wordt gebruikt voor trainingen en oefeningen met kleinere vliegtuigen.",
                                "translation": "The aircraft carrier is used for training and exercises with smaller aircraft.",
                                "english": "The aircraft carrier is used for training and exercises with smaller aircraft."
